{"title":"Lux LED Pre-lit Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the brilliance of Lux LED Lights, our most advanced lighting technology yet. Designed to elevate every holiday moment, Lux Lights deliver a brighter, more refined glow with enhanced color depth, premium micro LED bulbs, and customizable lighting modes that bring your tree to life. Whether you prefer a timeless warm white or vibrant multicolor display, enjoy effortless control with dimming, timer functions, and dynamic effects all crafted to create a luxurious holiday experience. Discover the next generation of Christmas tree lighting and make every celebration shine brighter than ever.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-silverpeak-fir-tree-led","title":"6.5' Silverpeak Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree 2500 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of holiday magic with the newest Silverpeak Fir, our most exquisitely crafted tree that transforms your home into a whimsical winter wonderland. Inspired by the majestic American White Fir, with every branch and needle meticulously designed to look impossibly real, you’d never believe it didn't come straight from the Rocky Mountains. Its full-bodied foliage, brilliant elegance, and layered shape create a breathtaking centerpiece that radiates warmth, joy, and festive charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5'","offer_id":44792072896712,"sku":"SLP-T6.5-L","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Silverpeakfir.png?v=1761067054"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-silverpeak-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Silverpeak Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree 3400 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of holiday magic with the newest Silverpeak Fir, our most exquisitely crafted tree that transforms your home into a whimsical winter wonderland. Inspired by the majestic American White Fir, with every branch and needle meticulously designed to look impossibly real, you’d never believe it didn't come straight from the Rocky Mountains. Its full-bodied foliage, brilliant elegance, and layered shape create a breathtaking centerpiece that radiates warmth, joy, and festive charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5'","offer_id":44792074764488,"sku":"SLP-T7.5-L","price":1199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Silverpeakfir.png?v=1761067054"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-slim-tree-lux-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree With 1800 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128135737544,"sku":"QFS-T7.5-LUX","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7.5_QueenFlockSlimArtificialChristmasTreewith1800LuxLEDLights.jpg?v=1782847365"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-lux-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 2500 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128138555592,"sku":"QF-T7.5-LUX","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7.5_QueenFlockArtificialChristmasTreeLux.jpg?v=1782848477"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-lux-led","title":"7' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree with 2000 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Green \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128139866312,"sku":"KNF-T7-LUX","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/7_KingNobleFirLuxLED.jpg?v=1782849139"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-lux-led","title":"7.5' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree 1800 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128144617672,"sku":"AFG-ST-7.5-LUX","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Alpinefirslim_36318a79-a4a2_1.jpg?v=1782923282"},{"product_id":"9-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-lux-led","title":"9' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree 3000 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128145273032,"sku":"AFG-ST-9-LUX","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Alpinefirslim_36318a79-a4a2_1.jpg?v=1782923282"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-alpine-fir-tree-lux-led","title":"7.5' Alpine Fir Artificial Christmas Tree 2500 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LUX LED","offer_id":45128150221000,"sku":"AFG-T7.5-LUX","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/AlpineFirwithLuxLEDLights.png?v=1782850052"},{"product_id":"9-foot-silverpeak-fir-tree-led","title":"9' Silverpeak Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree 4700 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of holiday magic with the newest Silverpeak Fir, our most exquisitely crafted tree that transforms your home into a whimsical winter wonderland. Inspired by the majestic American White Fir, with every branch and needle meticulously designed to look impossibly real, you’d never believe it didn't come straight from the Rocky Mountains. Its full-bodied foliage, brilliant elegance, and layered shape create a breathtaking centerpiece that radiates warmth, joy, and festive charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9'","offer_id":45128150778056,"sku":"SLP-T9-LUX","price":1899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Silverpeakfir.png?v=1761067054"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-soho-spruce-tree-lux-led","title":"7.5' Soho Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree 2000 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the beauty of a real Siberian Spruce into your home with a tree designed to capture its naturally elegant shape. Featuring layered branches, fine spruce-inspired needles, and a realistic open profile, it creates exceptional depth and dimension while maintaining a full, balanced appearance. The thoughtfully spaced branches provide the perfect backdrop for ornaments to shine, delivering a timeless look that feels both natural and refined throughout the holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45128150909128,"sku":"SHSP-T7.5-LUX","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/NewSohoSpruce.png?v=1783960631"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Lux_LED_Trees.png?v=1783443639","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/lux-led-pre-lit-artificial-christmas-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}